  "Description": {
    "Cost": 5448173,
    "UIName": "Septicemia",
    "Id": "chassisdef_septicemia_SPT-T",
    "Name": "Septicemia",
    "Details": "The T configuration of the Septicemia, the Society's utilitarian medium OmniMech designed for mass production, carries a Large Pulse Laser and two Medium Pulse Lasers in its arms, with a pair of Streak SRM-6 launchers and an LRM-10 in the side torsos. An advanced targeting computer sharpens its aim, a Supercharger gives it bursts of speed, and a Watchdog CEWS handles its electronic warfare, while CASE II protects the ammunition in both side torsos.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.08</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
